      "content": "that makes sense. i'm also trying to write a section on the demographics part of it. specifically, what are the typical profiles of the people moving in during a renewal phase vs the people who end up leaving? like, what kind of people usually drive the \"vibrancy\" of a new area and who is usually pushed out?",
